We're the largest manufacturer of explosive devices in the country,

467
00:38:45,160 --> 00:38:46,660
except that ours don't work.

468
00:38:47,940 --> 00:38:51,140
The training devices facility at Fort Gordon, Georgia,

469
00:38:51,780 --> 00:38:56,680
manufactures mock weapons for the U.S. military, police, and other organizations.

470
00:38:57,600 --> 00:39:01,020
Their top product? The suicide bomber's vest.

471
00:39:01,021 --> 00:39:04,700
What we're doing is making simulated devices

472
00:39:04,701 --> 00:39:07,460
so that they will know what the real thing looks like

473
00:39:07,461 --> 00:39:08,860
and how to react to the real thing.

474
00:39:10,300 --> 00:39:13,200
Suicide attacks are a tactic planned and organized

475
00:39:13,201 --> 00:39:16,480
by extremely committed military or paramilitary groups.

476
00:39:17,400 --> 00:39:20,380
Its history stretches back at least to the 11th century.

477
00:39:22,880 --> 00:39:26,820
A fanatical Persian cult known as the Order of the Assassins,

478
00:39:27,580 --> 00:39:31,060
fortified with hashish and visions of afterlife paradise,

479
00:39:31,640 --> 00:39:33,120
were ordered to kill enemy leaders.

480
00:39:34,700 --> 00:39:40,740
If they completed their mission, they could count on almost certain death at the hands of bodyguards.

481
00:39:43,500 --> 00:39:50,120
Until the present, perhaps the most notorious suicide bombers were the World War II Japanese kamikazes.

482
00:39:51,260 --> 00:39:54,580
Over 2,500 pilots sacrificed their lives.

483
00:39:58,740 --> 00:40:01,780
Today's suicide bombers frequently employ vehicles.

484
00:40:02,780 --> 00:40:04,920
Often, they simply wear the explosives.

485
00:40:06,100 --> 00:40:10,000
Since men and women throughout the Middle East now serve as suicide bombers,

486
00:40:10,960 --> 00:40:13,620
U.S. military personnel are at greater risk than ever.

487
00:40:16,160 --> 00:40:20,140
The Fort Gordon Training Center's replica of a suicide bomber vest

488
00:40:20,141 --> 00:40:24,500
prepares military personnel for this new kind of WMD.

489
00:40:25,660 --> 00:40:27,700
Everything here is a training device.

490
00:40:27,940 --> 00:40:29,220
Everything is commercially available.

491
00:40:29,221 --> 00:40:32,500
There is no secret technology that's being shown in this.

492
00:40:32,680 --> 00:40:36,980
There is nothing here which would help anyone make their own bomb.

493
00:40:37,460 --> 00:40:39,500
This is a training bomb vest.

494
00:40:39,860 --> 00:40:43,120
It is made up of plastic pipe that simulates explosives.

495
00:40:43,920 --> 00:40:46,760
It uses nail strips that simulates shrapnel.

496
00:40:47,360 --> 00:40:50,780
This has an alarm system that simulates a detonator.

497
00:40:51,160 --> 00:40:57,080
When this is triggered, it lets the people know that they are in a kill zone.

498
00:40:59,220 --> 00:41:05,360
Fort Gordon uses the vest in its ongoing training sessions for troops being sent to Iraq.

499
00:41:06,300 --> 00:41:12,420
What we have here is military soldiers dressed as Middle Eastern workers

500
00:41:12,421 --> 00:41:16,700
coming to a forward operating base to perform some form of task.

501
00:41:18,100 --> 00:41:20,660
What the military training guards don't know

502
00:41:20,661 --> 00:41:24,480
is that one of the masquerading workers has a bomb vest under his robe.

503
00:41:25,780 --> 00:41:28,160
What they're doing now is they have stopped the personnel

504
00:41:28,161 --> 00:41:30,500
and they've only stopped the first person

505
00:41:30,501 --> 00:41:32,020
and they've checked his ID

506
00:41:32,021 --> 00:41:33,920
and he said everybody was good

507
00:41:33,921 --> 00:41:36,440
and they allowed them into the forward operating base.

508
00:41:37,920 --> 00:41:40,540
What you're seeing now is you're seeing them come through the gate.

509
00:41:43,340 --> 00:41:45,260
Right now, you see the diversion

510
00:41:45,261 --> 00:41:50,000
and you see all the people crowding around

511
00:41:50,001 --> 00:41:51,880
to see what's going on, to lend help.

512
00:41:51,881 --> 00:41:54,560
You see this is the perfect time for the suicide bomber

513
00:41:54,561 --> 00:41:57,920
to detonate the bomb, killing as many people as possible.

514
00:41:58,160 --> 00:42:01,740
Anybody hearing the siren would be in the kill range.

515
00:42:02,120 --> 00:42:02,820
Halt!

516
00:42:02,821 --> 00:42:08,120
What you did wrong is you failed to search these Iraqis before they came in here,

517
00:42:08,121 --> 00:42:13,700
and you allowed an unsearched Iraqi in here, and one had a bomb on, as you can see here.

518
00:42:14,400 --> 00:42:17,360
Now what you see is them doing it correctly.

519
00:42:17,800 --> 00:42:21,200
They are halted, and one by one they are being searched.

520
00:42:21,920 --> 00:42:24,560
When you get to the bomber, the bomb is detected.

521
00:42:28,160 --> 00:42:31,920
Troops are instructed to shoot to kill the bomber,

522
00:42:32,400 --> 00:42:35,840
as well as sacrifice their own bodies to protect others from the blast.

523
00:42:38,180 --> 00:42:43,400
What you are doing is you're giving yourself up for the greater good of your battle buddies.

524
00:42:44,560 --> 00:42:49,660
The suicide bomber vest provides the realism that is needed to train soldiers

525
00:42:49,661 --> 00:42:54,460
so that they can actually see when they go to their first combat mission.

526
00:42:54,461 --> 00:43:00,100
Suicide bombers will pose a continued threat.

527
00:43:01,460 --> 00:43:04,760
Unfortunately, so will other weapons of mass destruction.

528
00:43:05,800 --> 00:43:11,260
Nuclear, biological, chemical, and radiological.

529
00:43:12,480 --> 00:43:17,040
For decades, technology has been instrumental in creating these weapons.

530
00:43:17,041 --> 00:43:26,200
Now, hopefully, our technology may help to prevent the staggering loss of life that these

531
00:43:26,201 --> 00:43:27,200
weapons promise.

